Subject: [PATCH 1/4] TAL: port to biosteam 2.54 / thermosteam 0.54 (import &
 simulate)

- units.py: import StirredTankReactor from abstract_stirred_tank_reactor when
  no longer exported by biosteam.units; pass V as V_max to BatchBioreactor
  (renamed; identical vessel sizing).
- process_areas.py: positional Series access via .iloc (pandas >= 3).
- solubility model: OS-independent data file path.
- chemicals_data.py: give CaSO4 a liquid molar volume (= solid) since sparse
  flow vectors can hold explicit zero entries.
